<title>INDIA: CRICKET-S.AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Australia by seven wickets in their round-robin triangular series one-day cricket match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 219-7 in 50 overs; South Africa 220-3 in 46.1 overs.</p>
